meta {
  name: Sliders
  seq: 14
}

docs {
  # App Sliders

  Sliders are small promotional banners for the mobile app home screen.

  Frontend controls the displayed size and carousel layout. Backend stores the
  image URL, active state, order, and optional clickable `linkUrl`.

  Recommended image guidance for admin uploads:

  - use a consistent banner ratio, for example 1080 x 420 px;
  - keep images under 2MB;
  - use JPG, PNG, or WebP;
  - avoid putting critical text near the edges because frontend may crop or fit
    differently across devices.

  `linkUrl` is optional. It can be an HTTPS URL, app deep link, or app path. If
  it is empty, tapping the banner should do nothing.
}
